      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ギスコは財宝の隠し場所を暗号で書き残した。\n『バアルの恵みの水面を見つめし巨像、\n彼女の指差す石柱を調べよ』\nもし解けたら、財宝を持ち帰ってくれ。",
        "official_en": "Gisco left a riddle revealing the location of his hidden\ntreasure. \"A colossus gazes upon Baal's waters.\nOn the stone where she points, something worthy\nof note.\" If you solve it, could I see the treasure?",
        "real_en": null
      },
